      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2086b59a538c096a935a3119",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "别老是打听我小时候的回忆啦，\r\n也不全是美好的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f55b5cec0b97287d5dc12bad7a3112a3977e260451099cc73e0a67df1aaf1f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f77f8a9f5283ed403993badc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以前给赖恩添了不少麻烦……\r\n但现在，我可以昂首挺胸地告诉她不用担心我了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f51e97f324a3449c785e2efd6d883fa2b0b6dea7291a666a762fbdc594f4ff0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4479334d17f9be9c5b090951",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你有弟弟或者妹妹吗？\r\n跟小孩子打交道这种事情……\r\n……没、没事。只是问问看而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37482f7a6e3c34bbaeae1474ef09e51ba51e22031c0838acffeca61023dbc831",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c214ac177bfbf6a137c41e71",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白家的大家都是凛然又优雅，\r\n都非常出色呢。\r\n……我和她们就不一样了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1216f77b8f0e5dc68a6ec770204c958c496b6861dee3177391c5193f48fa014c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bc347da946bfc8bf26609eb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大家都说这套衣服和我很搭……\r\n但是……一定都是客套话吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4248e4b86083fd042dbeb833b86f260be6cfd0446c8de30def53f158d77a212",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efa383502d17e6e87d0060e1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哒、哒、哒～……♪\r\n呵呵，轻飘飘的……啊？！\r\n没、没有！这是在练习而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6c47f583820ec1f87b1d14c317e140bfc80f5c1b81a458c9990a23992a95a6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60fd61beb121a754318be7b7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这可是满怀着我的心意的衣服，\r\n穿上它的话可得拿出不令其蒙羞的实力才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd7bb1871196feca272aec8ea3a0667fb48d7f85d8bc87741d782d15127b18b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aab8ea9174f59b67e8d761a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……是不是有点可爱过头了啊。\r\n……没、没有！这是我自己定好的衣服，\r\n一定要堂堂正正地……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a96817e5fd78c0f0cc0b4df36393a0e90909f82b4c16a1d054eb25580c473cd0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecacdba9e4924b7399e4f652",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然时常想早起晨练，\r\n但大树起床发现我不在的话，\r\n她一定会觉得寂寞的吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "156d47bc89d1041fac65e67d394d8511446c34c0160c829ae6f2bed5603b1145",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18110e599fcb8c7ac30ab82a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "漫画里常看见角色们亲手做便当呢……\r\n我也要试着做做看吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ee6a11a7ae154298ee11e4d688e0b5024961d15d1c015ebd0fd68201c3253d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3366c599b187c3129d8ab359",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在晚上训练更容易让人冷静呢……\r\n感觉不到其他人的视线，\r\n也更容易集中精力……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "340caf52bb82dfc19d7d4200ffd9e83db79dae1ea552ccb5967103b6fe87ea56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d10ba187b4831c66d1cd40c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我还挺喜欢赏花的，\r\n毕竟大家都只会关注着美丽的花而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fddeb7249d13cb687d3fe7eb9d5d34ec44913e4d9df0e8d7abd1e8b244d7bfc9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59fe66ceae3d04de7509735b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "昨天夜里，\r\n好像听见了类似于雷鸣的声音呢……\r\n哈啊……虽然我还蛮喜欢下雨的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed3dd29565facec94373479ab2b86c3e736e71c369eaf9b1d0fbd6ef0612b5ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23e1b763da2073523eaee60d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说起来，今天目白家的大家要举办茶会呢。\r\n……呵呵，红叶之下的茶会，好期待呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed21fd5466095d0b372770a758796fe2c4798464ecc789194b1a8caf1be2efbe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04efd087121dc9bc79b15770",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "控制甜食的摄入，然后……\r\n啊啊真是的……\r\n为什么冬天就容易不小心长胖啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9101d521b719866d8d4e7d670893d835f30e884a89043ccb4b2d798bfce59850",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddc6d66e5cbf591cc4066b44",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『就像模特那样超酷的！』\r\n善信她真是太温柔了，\r\n有时候实在是夸我夸过头啦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8aae0654d642941b85db1684bf72c549c666b6c3cb5b2f5b699de635a2c9cbf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91016"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91016"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a20c7ad3c06a177f5911cfe",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然我也挺喜欢穿这身出门的，\r\n但总会在不知不觉间绕远路，这可是个难题啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dadfe3837b7fa07dce74e9083176f23cafbd9efd6b80193538fe14ddc32c5c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91017"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91017"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfddc6f25f19a6e74ee726fb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你刚刚没看见我的背吧？！\r\n哈啊……没想到晒痕这么久都消不掉啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b79491c6c47a6f7685b5357b22c31e268190fc35c1e8045cb5b8321d882b8bd5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91018"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91018"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aa675601d8632ddfd681a09",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯……感觉不错。出门前\r\n根据目的地不同多配些芳香剂吧……\r\n说不定也正好能当作转换心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28bc24c4a9afbe36ae84ae2c072ff190a39213f5bc0f05aa119912766dbc5829",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91019"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91019"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c77aa3a7b5be8c2ce59d344",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本来在学园里饲养猛禽应该是件非常危险的事……\r\n但既然他们关系这么好的话……\r\n总之，还是多加注意比较好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f0a6a653fa19891a4a8a0fc72fa7f115b5c6600cc72fa86420f783f889aee3c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91020"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91020"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d94a31e2ab869448fb4f4e4e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，今早碰见的那只狗狗的毛……\r\n最近散步的时候经常碰见它呢，\r\n呵呵……它真是又调皮又可爱呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7db72583b8ff1ab23d8fccdbe762386a2117e3577dc329ea9b26bad264b5608",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6da9c93456d06c6c354f22aa",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原来BBQ是每周末都能搞的\r\n活动吗？！她们每周都来邀请我……\r\n啊！难道说这是大树开的玩笑吗？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48321a6e86a7d5c99956d76ebe226a3f78bf1f2d61602c1cd90e0673cb51ef04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91022"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91022"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a7841b1157b6808a877dcef",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听荒漠说，睡前读书有助入眠呢……\r\n要是有效果的话，就去向荒漠道谢吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "219489b37a85362032bb55036c4f8119c873870b9e76bbeb0fed2ea8b3379c18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91023"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91023"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd6854ad8238afdbe735e983",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵……怎么样？这样笑的话，\r\n新生也会觉得我更容易搭话吧？\r\n还是说，嘴角再上扬一点比较好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9fc2bee354bc59c110163eac5dbefdc8541bfe6a339afdf7db573c74f21be43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91024"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1059/91024"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc50735f5a5746fff4a49185",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是太阳太毒的话，戴一顶帽子怎么样？\r\n为了预防中暑，我选了宽帽檐款的……\r\n你、你别选和我同款的啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "739b7f4438da3a84b7123652f2154140de9fb47f1c12b6f4911203b174e51b33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
